            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Primarch. Flagship issues 3 Fleet Orders each phase; once per turn an additional Reload Ordnance order does not count against cap. Demigod of War +3.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      <profile id="4254ee27-44d9-4985-b3d0-6db5c018a3e5" name="Primarch Embarkation" hidden="false" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">May only be selected in a 2,000+ point fleet and must ride this Legion's Gloriana as Fleet Commander. Rogal Dorn may instead ride the Phalanx where permitted.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles>
